{"id":"n81800-1-7","stage":4,"title":"절실하다 · 切实","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n81800-1-7-1","ko":"아, 오늘도 야근이야. 벌써 몇 주째 이게 뭐니.","zh":"啊，今天又要加班了。都已经好几周这样了，这到底算什么啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아,","meaning":"咳","explanation":"아：咳。","readings":[{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16247","senseId":"3","lemma":"아","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}},{"text":"오늘도","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘도","audio":"/audio/77d25b815bea9e75c627.mp3"}},{"text":"야근이야.","meaning":"加班","explanation":"야근：加班；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"야근","audio":"/audio/e8aeeb6fc5aa42e226b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90303","senseId":"1","lemma":"야근","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"야근이야","audio":"/audio/d42c493fc612e7c5821e.mp3"}},{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经。","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}},{"text":"몇","meaning":"几，多少","explanation":"몇：几，多少。","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"2","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}},{"text":"주째","meaning":"一周，一星期","explanation":"주：一周，一星期；째：名词后缀，构成派生名词。","readings":[{"term":"주","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26897","senseId":"1","lemma":"주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주째","audio":"/audio/20292ac81d2ae25b4b51.mp3"}},{"text":"이게","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이것：这个；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이것","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44878","senseId":"2","lemma":"이것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이게","audio":"/audio/080ef3b94e3a9d861970.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐니.","meaning":"什么，怎么回事","explanation":"뭐：什么，怎么回事；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"3","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐니","audio":"/audio/c123f71de2e0a9dffdf5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d6ce479be9ddc9b7","term":"아","zh":"咳","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3","entryId":"16247","definition":"感到烦恼、担心、惋惜、叹息时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["아"]},{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"e8aeeb6fc5aa42e2","term":"야근","zh":"加班","audio":"/audio/e8aeeb6fc5aa42e226b8.mp3","entryId":"90303","definition":"过了下班时间后工作到很晚。","pronunciation":["야ː근"]},{"id":"d038c1cb7ee215cb","term":"벌써","zh":"已经","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3","entryId":"58977","definition":"比想象早地。","pronunciation":["벌써"]},{"id":"37ca98883f5001d4","term":"몇","zh":"几，多少","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3","entryId":"66235","definition":"用于询问不知道的数目。","pronunciation":["멷"]},{"id":"6234d5b178a8b258","term":"주","zh":"一周，一星期","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3","entryId":"26897","definition":"周一到周日的七天时间。","pronunciation":["주"]},{"id":"e414d84c28c86213","term":"이것","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3","entryId":"44878","definition":"指代前面刚刚提到的对象。","pronunciation":["이걷"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么，怎么回事","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"对于已经发生的意外事件或状况，强调自己